{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-4-4","kind":"proposition","title":"三角形内切圆的尺规作图","englishTitle":"In a given triangle to inscribe a circle.","book":4,"number":4,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.4","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.4/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":4,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷四"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-4-4@raw-f1251eb14cce8cbf","contentId":"euclid-4-4","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f1251eb14cce8cbf98c131ba205ea4da5b29d6b928fc6f6eb46ee165f2adb12a","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-4-4.statement","euclid-4-4.construction.1","euclid-4-4.construction.2","euclid-4-4.proof.1","euclid-4-4.proof.2","euclid-4-4.proof.3","euclid-4-4.proof.4","euclid-4-4.construction.3","euclid-4-4.conclusion","euclid-4-4.historical.1","euclid-4-4.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-4-4.statement","contentId":"euclid-4-4","revisionId":"euclid-4-4@raw-f1251eb14cce8cbf","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ada7af885505984df9780452f62793806f53be0a3f69075d69e3b711612e3776","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In a given triangle to inscribe a circle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在一个指定的三角形中输入圆。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"三角形求作形内切圜"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"求三角形的内切圆。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-4.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-4-4","revisionId":"euclid-4-4@raw-f1251eb14cce8cbf","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5265098e2ffe227769997d4b4f27fd1609b7a1c8b1f28bdbef745b83d43e72d2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC be the given triangle; thus it is required to inscribe a circle in the triangle ABC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让 ABC 成为给定的三角形; 因此, 必须在三角形 ABC 中输入圆 。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-4.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-4-4","revisionId":"euclid-4-4@raw-f1251eb14cce8cbf","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"997553ee700071dcf2bcfc9cceb1bc201d3a90efcd2cbd75c3d310cf40ed07d7","citations":["euclid-1-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the angles ABC, ACB be bisected by the straight lines BD, CD [[I. 9](/principles/euclid-1-9)], and let these meet one another at the point D; from D let DE, DF, DG be drawn perpendicular to the straight lines AB, BC, CA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC、ACB角被BD、CD直线分开,让这些角在D点相互相交;从D让DE、DF、DG直线直线划到AB、BC、CA直线。 [[I. 9](/principles/euclid-1-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-4.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-4-4","revisionId":"euclid-4-4@raw-f1251eb14cce8cbf","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5fe980df61f0d4e5674565d1e9b33a79658a93d0b5434285dcaca09b450a20cc","citations":["euclid-1-26"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since the angle ABD is equal to the angle CBD, and the right angle BED is also equal to the right angle BFD, EBD, FBD are two triangles having two angles equal to two angles and one side equal to one side, namely that subtending one of the equal angles, which is BD common to the triangles; therefore they will also have the remaining sides equal to the remaining sides; [[I. 26](/principles/euclid-1-26)] therefore DE is equal to DF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于角度ABD等于角度CBD,直角 BED也等于直角 BFD,EBD,FBD是两个三角,两个角度等于两个角度,一边等于一面,即从一个角度向另一个角度划分,这个角度与三角共有BD;因此,它们也使其余的两面等于其余两边;因此,DE等于DF。 [[I. 26](/principles/euclid-1-26)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-4.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-4-4","revisionId":"euclid-4-4@raw-f1251eb14cce8cbf","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1db0b2b398abc0b4bd7ccd35c9cd1cca1a3b18f1d39e22e4188e3c8f3ffc927e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason DG is also equal to DF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,DG也等于DF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-4.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-4-4","revisionId":"euclid-4-4@raw-f1251eb14cce8cbf","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"14f78d0d1bba430d049862040c23e264df0770a7d5e53dd53df695badb32ce4d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the three straight lines DE, DF, DG are equal to one another; therefore the circle described with centre D and distance one of the straight lines DE, DF, DG will pass also through the remaining points, and will touch the straight lines AB, BC, CA, because the angles at the points E, F, G are right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,三条直线DE、DF、DG等同;因此,以D中点和DE、DF、DG中线的距离之一描述的圆圈也将通过其余的点,并将触及AB、BC、CA直线,因为E、F、G点的角是正确的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-4.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-4-4","revisionId":"euclid-4-4@raw-f1251eb14cce8cbf","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"817e345cb2ce92612ac07874d91994754f2f01f199c7d9c98bbc46fc6bca967d","citations":["euclid-3-16","euclid-4-def-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if it cuts them, the straight line drawn at right angles to the diameter of the circle from its extremity will be found to fall within the circle : which was proved absurd; [[III. 16](/principles/euclid-3-16)] therefore the circle described with centre D and distance one of the straight lines DE, DF, DG will not cut the straight lines AB, BC, CA; therefore it will touch them, and will be the circle inscribed in the triangle ABC. [[IV. Def. 5](/principles/euclid-4-def-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果将线切开,则从极端直角点至圆直径的直线将划入圆圈内:事实证明,这是荒谬的;因此,以D中点和DE、DF、DG直线之一的距离描述的圆圈不会切断直线AB、BC、CA;因此,它会触碰直线,并且将是三角ABC所标定的圆圈。 [[III. 16](/principles/euclid-3-16)] [[IV. Def. 5](/principles/euclid-4-def-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-4.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-4-4","revisionId":"euclid-4-4@raw-f1251eb14cce8cbf","order":7,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b43b68eeb9e739db5464fd5f5a45fd99e2af98a022fcdd1149a3e399aade8346","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be inscribed, as FGE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它被刻上FGE"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-4.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-4-4","revisionId":"euclid-4-4@raw-f1251eb14cce8cbf","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"acfd2e8e33d07caaddf55d525786f63f860d3686890c2581416cddd25886b97d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore in the given triangle ABC the circle EFG has been inscribed. Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在给定的三角形ABC中,EFG圆被标为Q. E.F。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-4.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-4-4","revisionId":"euclid-4-4@raw-f1251eb14cce8cbf","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dacdeee8ecae4d06753d3ffc594b690ab0b15034ba047b139855a358e4a02e15","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"三角形求作形内切圜法曰甲乙丙角形求作形内切圜先以甲乙丙角甲丙乙角各两平分之〈一卷九〉作乙丁丙丁两直线相遇于丁次自丁至角形之三边各作垂线为丁己丁庚丁戊其戊丁乙角形之丁戊乙丁乙戊两角与乙丁己角形之丁己乙丁乙己两角各等乙丁同边即丁戊丁己两边亦等〈一卷〉〈廿六〉依显丁丙己角形与丁庚丙角形之丁己丁庚两边亦等即丁戊丁己丁庚三线俱等末作圜以丁为心戊为界即过庚己为戊庚己圜而切角形之甲乙乙丙丙甲三边于戊于己于庚〈三卷十六之系〉此为形内切圜"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"构造三角形内切圆的方法如下：甲乙丙 要找到三角形的内切圆，首先用 甲乙丙 和 甲丙乙 作为 〈一卷九〉 的平分线。这两条线在 丁 相交，然后从 丁 向三角形的三条边画垂线，作为 丁己丁庚丁戊、戊丁乙 和 丁戊乙丁乙戊，乙丁己 等于 乙丁，即 丁戊丁己 和 丁戊丁己 是相同的边 〈一卷〉〈廿六〉。丁丙己 三角形和 丁庚丙 三角形 丁己丁庚 也相等，即 丁戊丁己丁庚 和 丁戊丁己丁庚 全都相等。最后，以 丁 为圆心，戊 为界，经过 庚己 画圆形成 戊庚己 圆，而三边 甲乙乙丙丙甲 和 己 为 庚〈三卷十六之系〉，这是内切圆。"}]},{"id":"euclid-4-4.source","contentId":"euclid-4-4","revisionId":"euclid-4-4@raw-f1251eb14cce8cbf","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0ef14bf78bc8fa52a39650634e7c9f0ea244929473adab41a3809848bedeb8ca","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.4/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.4\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷四"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-4-4:euclid-1-9:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-4","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-4.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-9","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.4","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.4/","sourceLabel":"I. 9"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-4:euclid-1-26:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-4","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-4.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-26","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.4","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.4/","sourceLabel":"I. 26"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-4:euclid-3-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-4","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-4.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-3-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.4","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.4/","sourceLabel":"III. 16"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-4-4:euclid-4-def-5:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-4-4","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-4-4.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-4-def-5","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.4","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:4.prop.4/","sourceLabel":"IV. Def. 5"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-4:euclid-1-9:explicit","id":"euclid-1-9","book":1,"number":9,"kind":"proposition","title":"角平分线的尺规作图","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-4:euclid-1-26:explicit","id":"euclid-1-26","book":1,"number":26,"kind":"proposition","title":"三角形全等：两角和对应边相等","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-4:euclid-3-16:explicit","id":"euclid-3-16","book":3,"number":16,"kind":"proposition","title":"圆的切线垂直于切点处的半径","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-4-4:euclid-4-def-5:explicit","id":"euclid-4-def-5","book":4,"number":5,"kind":"definition","title":"直线图形的内切圆","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-polygon","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
